# SDKMAN environment for the Płomień Kostrze backend.
# Pins the Java toolchain so `sdk env` (in this directory) selects a matching JDK.
# Matches the system JDK installed via apt (openjdk 21.0.11). If SDKMAN reports this
# exact build is unavailable, run `sdk list java` and pick the nearest 21.0.x-tem.
# Fetch it with: sdk env install
java=21.0.11-tem
